  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Rich tooltip configurations</h3><p><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Rich tooltips provide additional context about a UI element. They can optionally contain a subhead, buttons, and hyperlinks.\" link-label link-url should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Rich tooltips</app-froala-tooltip-element> can have a headline, body, and up to two <app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Buttons let people take action and make choices with one tap.\" link-label=\"More on buttons\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/common-buttons/overview\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">buttons</app-froala-tooltip-element>. The headline and number of buttons can be configured.</p>"
  },
